  "status": "present",
  "value": "transactions is a list of [payer, payee, amount] rows (party names are strings, payer != payee, amount a positive integer number of cents). Every row moves amount from payer to payee. The end-of-day balance of a party is the total it received minus the total it paid. Level 1: return [party, balance] for every party that appears in any row, including zero balances, sorted by party name in code-point order.",
